  "tier": 2,
  "name": "Operations Network C",
  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 2 with vertical lanes: hub at the top, exit room at the bottom, long switchback corridors.",
    "Route A (left): loop on the upper vertical, conveyor on the long middle vertical (A2), MFA/hardened gate (A3), service/paired hazard near the exit (A4).",
    "Route B (centre): cart ride on the right-hand vertical (B2), gate (B3), service/paired hazard (B4).",
    "Route C (right): conveyor on the long inner vertical (C3) and a gate near the bottom (C4).",
    "A3, B3 and C4 accept the carried T1_MAINT permission as a shortcut. Zero-day reward at the hub cell [15,3].",
    "Exit trigger is cell [19,35]; one fixed camera at [23,36]."
  ],
